Archaeologist Fiona Grantly has argued that the abandonment of Pueblo Bonito in Chaco Canyon around 1150 CE was driven primarily by prolonged drought, which made the region''s agriculture unsustainable. Tree-ring data from the area show a severe dry period lasting nearly five decades.

Text 2:
While environmental stress certainly played a role, archaeologist David Kessler contends that political fragmentation was the more decisive factor in Pueblo Bonito''s decline. Kessler points to evidence of deliberate destruction of ceremonial structures and the cessation of long-distance trade networks, patterns that suggest internal social collapse rather than a simple resource shortage.', $lyceon_json$[{"key":"A","text":"By agreeing that drought was the sole cause but suggesting that it lasted longer than Grantly estimated"},{"key":"B","text":"By acknowledging environmental pressures but arguing that political factors were more important in causing the abandonment"},{"key":"C","text":"By rejecting the tree-ring evidence as unreliable and proposing an alternative dating method"},{"key":"D","text":"By asserting that Pueblo Bonito was never fully abandoned and continued to be inhabited through the drought"}]$lyceon_json$::jsonb, 'B', NULL, E'Text 2 explicitly states that "environmental stress certainly played a role" but argues that "political fragmentation was the more decisive factor," directly acknowledging drought while elevating political causes above it. The choice stating agreement that drought was the sole cause contradicts Text 2, which explicitly names political fragmentation as more decisive. The choice about rejecting tree-ring evidence has no basis in either text; Kessler does not question the dating methodology. The choice claiming Pueblo Bonito was never abandoned contradicts both texts, which accept that abandonment occurred and debate only its cause.', $lyceon_json${"A":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"detail_misread"},"B":{"role":"correct","error_taxonomy":null},"C":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"inference_overreach"},"D":{"role":"distractor","error_taxonomy":"detail_misread"}}$lyceon_json$::jsonb, NULL, 'draft', 1, 60, false, $lyceon_json${"provenance":"Lyceon original","authored_by":"claude","authored_date":"2026-08-28"}$lyceon_json$